 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls**
-*   **Local Minima:** Optimization from scratch on the first frame may converge to local minima if the initial pose is far from the ground truth. Warm starting subsequent frames mitigates this for video sequences [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Joint Pose Optimization:** Camera and robot poses are optimized jointly when both are unknown. The method also supports reconstruction with known camera or robot parameters, or using multiple views at once [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Local Minima:** Optimization from scratch on the first frame may converge to local minima if the initial pose is far from the ground truth [G]. Warm starting subsequent frames mitigates this for video sequences [S1, unofficial].
